  triage:snippet "Replace foreground sync_message_projection* / template sync calls with one private, bounded idle drain owned by the existing SqliteWriter. The drain runs only after the documented quiet interval; it yields to foreground submissions, processes a bounded batch in one transaction, and is idempotent." ;
